# Environment template (COMMITTED). Copy to `.env.local` for local development — that file is
# gitignored and must never be committed. Keep real credentials in a secret store, never here.
#
# The app reads its configuration from `application.yaml` (and `spring.config.import`); use
# `.env.local` only for local overrides that your run scripts load. Uncomment and set as needed:
#
# SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=local
# SERVER_PORT=8080
